msgstr "コードの提供"

#: contributing/ways_to_contribute.rst:53
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The possibility to study, use, modify and redistribute modifications of the "
"engine's source code are the fundamental rights that Rebel Engine's `MIT "
"<https://www.tldrlegal.com/license/mit-license>`__ license grants you, "
"making it `free and open source software <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Free_and_open-source_software>`__."
msgstr ""
"エンジンのソースコードの変更を調査、使用、変更、および再配布が出来る可能性"
