#: tutorials/performance/cpu_optimization.rst:160
msgid ""
"Rebel Engine supports a number of different languages, and it is worth "
"bearing in mind that there are trade-offs involved. Some languages are "
"designed for ease of use at the cost of speed, and others are faster but "
"more difficult to work with."
