"状況では遅いアルゴリズムや、高速であるが使いやすさを難しくするアルゴリズムよ"
"りも常に好まれます。"

#: tutorials/performance/index.rst:32
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Rebel Engine is not an exception to this. While it is designed to have "
"backends swappable for different algorithms, the default backends prioritize "
