#: tutorials/shaders/advanced_postprocessing.rst:74
msgid "Depth texture"
msgstr "深度テクスチャ"

#: tutorials/shaders/advanced_postprocessing.rst:76
msgid ""
"To read from the depth texture, perform a texture lookup using ``texture()`` "
