msgid "Customizing a project"
msgstr "プロジェクトの作成"

#: tutorials/ui/gui_skinning.rst:154
msgid ""
"Out of the box each project adopts the default project theme provided by "
"Rebel Engine. The default theme itself is constant and cannot be changed, "
"but its items can be overridden with a custom theme. Custom themes can be "
"applied in two ways: as a project setting, and as a node property throughout "
"the tree of control nodes."
