#: tutorials/vr/openvr/vr_starter_tutorial_part_one.rst:942
msgid "Creating a base class for interactable VR objects"
msgstr "対話可能なVRオブジェクトの基本クラスを作成する"

#: tutorials/vr/openvr/vr_starter_tutorial_part_one.rst:944
