msgstr "このチュートリアルの後半で ``sphere_ui`` のコードを追加します！"

#: tutorials/vr/openvr/vr_starter_tutorial_part_two.rst:172
msgid ""
"Now the ``Sphere_Target`` is ready to be used, but we don't have any way to "
